   22-24, 2019},
Organization = {Finnish Assoc Civil Engineers, Sustainabil Lab Oy SLAB},
Abstract = {The purpose of the study is to investigate data on climate implication
   and adaptation measures for energy use in buildings. It is based on a
   scoping literature review, concerned mainly with the main journals
   operating in the field of climate adaptation of the built environment.
   Research documents that significant changes are taking place due to the
   implications of climatic change. Studies concerning climate change
   impact on energy use in buildings in warm climates represent the
   majority of the findings. The volume of research within the consequences
   for the built environment in cold regions is found to be surprisingly
   low, especially concerning the pecuniary stakes involved. However,
   significant regional differences are observed. Though further research
   is of essence, policy/regulatory measures ought already to be taken,
   based on climate scenarios.},
