Abstract = {They were investigated, observed and analyzed about the windbreak and
   sand-fixation forests configuration structure, windbreak and
   sand-fixation benefits, and soil improvement effect of Maow-usu sandy
   land area of Yulin, the results showed that its structure type of
   windbreak and sand-fixation forests was close with the affection of
   windbreak and sand-fixation. Tree height and crown width played the
   leading role in wind prevention efficiency, and afforestation density,
   surface branch number and herb coverage were closely related with
   sand-fixation affection. If the condition was allowed, windbreak and
   sand-fixation forests should be constructed by using the fixture
   structure of arbors and bushes. The close relationship of moisture
   profit and loss of windbreak and sand-fixation forest and herb density
   was y = -0.0002 x(2)+ 1.3034 x - 1181.2 (R-2 = 0.9614). Biomass in unit
   area in windbreak and sand-fixation forests was higher in the areas
   among hills than in windward slopes. There was a positive correlation
   between the single cluster biomass and crown widths of the shrubs, the
   relational coefficient was 0.82. The organic matters in woodland soil in
   windbreak and sand-fixation forest had increased significantly, and the
   nutrient status had improved greatly, but overall the soil was still
   poor.},
