   grasp of the poverty-stricken ethnic minority areas of urban poverty and
   urban poverty groups, this article is not only a good grasp of the
   connotation of the poverty-stricken ethnic minority areas and the urban
   poor groups, and more systematic discussion of the ethnic groups in the
   region the status quo of urban poverty. In the meantime, this article
   not only reveals the causes of urban poverty in the minority areas but
