   Express \& Akeri AB},
Abstract = {Despite its crucial importance, water receives undesirably low
   prominence on the political agenda and is often too little featured in
   the media. The workshop discussed means of boosting awareness and
   understanding of the issues. Understanding the ``unwritten rules{''} of
   media and building active relationships will help; a well elaborated
   strategy for reaching a specific target group is essential, using the
   most appropriate media. Other channels of communication, e.g. education
   and marketing campaigns, can be extremely valuable.},
