Abstract = {With the rapid development of social economy, the rapid improvement of
   people's living standards and the increase of car ownership, the
   problems of residential road traffic and landscape are becoming more and
   more serious. Residential area is closely related to human health and
   its development is a symbol of urban progress. The planning and design
   of green ecological residential area has become the focus of common
   concern in China and even in the world. Based on the concept of green
   ecology, this paper discusses how to plan and design residential roads
   and landscape. At the end of this paper, the design method of road and
   landscape in residential area is analysed through practical application
